    description: { en: "'Maximum order quantity has been met' on Tradovate (Rule #555): a contract cap is blocking your order. Cut size or raise Max Position to trade again fast.", de: "'Maximum order quantity has been met' bei Tradovate (Regel #555): Eine Kontraktobergrenze blockiert deine Order. Reduziere die Größe oder erhöhe Max Position, um schnell wieder zu handeln.", es: "'Maximum order quantity has been met' en Tradovate (Regla #555): un tope de contratos bloquea tu orden. Reduce el tamaño o sube Max Position para volver a operar rápido.", fr: "'Maximum order quantity has been met' sur Tradovate (Règle #555) : un plafond de contrats bloque votre ordre. Réduisez la taille ou augmentez Max Position pour retrader rapidement.", it: "'Maximum order quantity has been met' su Tradovate (Regola #555): un limite di contratti blocca il tuo ordine. Riduci la size o aumenta Max Position per tornare subito a operare." },
