    description: { en: "Fix a Products Permitted order rejection by adding the contract to your Risk Settings allow-list, or disable the restriction to trade the symbol again.", de: "Behebe eine Products-Permitted-Ablehnung, indem du den Kontrakt zur Allow-List in den Risk Settings hinzufügst oder die Einschränkung deaktivierst, um das Symbol wieder zu handeln.", es: "Corrige un rechazo de orden por Products Permitted añadiendo el contrato a la lista blanca de tus Risk Settings, o desactivando la restricción para volver a operar el símbolo.", fr: "Corrigez un rejet d'ordre Products Permitted en ajoutant le contrat à la liste blanche de vos Risk Settings, ou désactivez la restriction pour retrader le symbole.", it: "Risolvi un rifiuto Products Permitted aggiungendo il contratto alla allow-list nelle tue Risk Settings, oppure disattiva la restrizione per tornare a operare sul simbolo." },
